  "Setelah 8 detik tanpa hit diterima, pulihkan 1 Qi Shield bila charge kosong. Maksimal 1 charge dari pasif; hit dan block mereset waktu. Pause membekukan waktu. Continue memulai jeda baru, bukan shield gratis.": "After 8 seconds without a hit or block, recover 1 empty Qi Shield charge. This passive supplies at most 1 charge; hits and blocks reset its timer. Pause freezes time. Continue starts a fresh delay, not a free shield.",
