  "Hit memberi Racun Giok: 4 tick selama 4 detik, masing-masing 6% damage hit. Tidak menumpuk. Hit lebih kuat menaikkan damage tick tersisa tanpa memperpanjang durasi. Boss menerima separuh damage.": "Hits inflict Jade Venom: 4 ticks over 4 seconds, each dealing 6% of hit damage. Does not stack. Stronger hits improve remaining ticks without extending duration. Bosses take half damage.",
  "Armor mengurangi damage masuk 8%, setelah Iron Body. Tidak mengubah hitbox atau durasi invulnerable.": "Armor reduces incoming damage by 8%, after Iron Body. Hitboxes and invulnerability duration are unchanged.",
  "Hit memberi Burn: 3 tick selama 3 detik, masing-masing 9% damage hit. Tidak menumpuk. Hit lebih kuat menaikkan damage tick tersisa tanpa memperpanjang durasi. Boss menerima separuh damage.": "Hits inflict Burn: 3 ticks over 3 seconds, each dealing 9% of hit damage. Does not stack. Stronger hits improve remaining ticks without extending duration. Bosses take half damage."
}
